type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/dsfranca/IsingBlockNumerics"
url: "https://dsfranca.github.io/IsingBlockNumerics/"
title: "IsingBlockNumerics: Certified finite-block influences for the square-lattice Ising model"
authors:
  - family-names: Rouzé
    given-names: Cambyse
    affiliation: "Inria, Télécom Paris, LTCI, Institut Polytechnique de Paris, Palaiseau, France"
